    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RED NIGHT</strong> is an anthology game that pits you against a demonic AI as the game master, challenging you to face a different fear in each level, all unique from one another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The list of levels is available in the Early Access section, and you can follow the development of each level on Discord.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736780/extras/4a01d8f734b31f5cebb5ebed68464c71.avif?t=1755186668\" data-has-big width=800 height=370 /></span></p>",
